{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989980/extras/ac4b83d8004f286ca97bcb3ef5d71568.webp?t=1756581908\" width=350 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Dun Dun Crawl</strong> is a game where you take monsters under your command, fight through engaging battles, master skills, explore, and survive mini-games to grow stronger with each passing death. Will you uncover the mystery behind the dungeon?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989980/extras/0be74cffd754dd9fa75908dbeecfdce1.webp?t=1756581908\" width=350 height=50 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless dungeon exploration:</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a resettable dungeon while keeping some progress.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Monster Battles:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command your monsters with unique skills, items, and equipment.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomized Mini-Games:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face fast, engaging challenges that reward skill and strategy.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monster Growth &amp; Evolution:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up, evolve, and fuse monsters with soul cores.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Increasing Difficulty &amp; Replayability:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeon zones get harder as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989980/extras/6ad4620a03c43350ffdb9c16c396328e.webp?t=1756581908\" width=350 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Enemies grow stronger with each passing level, while your monsters rely on strategy, items, and timing. Execute skills at the right moment to boost your monster\u2019s power during combat and seize the advantage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989980/extras/021e8fed1c0238766f7ff4e9788e31fb.webp?t=1756581908\" width=350 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989980/extras/f3f6750f8facbde07bfe934290dee707.poster.avif?t=1756581908\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989980/extras/f3f6750f8facbde07bfe934290dee707.webm?t=1756581908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989980/extras/191ac1775d8a2f86bc703ba1474818bd.poster.avif?t=1756581908\" width=128 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989980/extras/191ac1775d8a2f86bc703ba1474818bd.webm?t=1756581908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989980/extras/7981e11001410e6156627d9c38ff45f9.po